  id: vord_burrower
  displayName: Vord Burrower
  description: Lives beneath the ground in any stronghold. Ambushes players who walk
    over loose dirt.
  tier: 0
  family: 5
  behaviors:
  - Hides underground until player walks within 3m.
  - Bursts up for one big attack, then re-burrows.
  - Telegraphs surface position with rumbling sound and dust.
  - Cannot follow player onto built grid platforms.
  abilities:
  - "Surface Strike \u2014 emerges with claw attack"
  - "Burrow \u2014 escapes underground"
  - "Drag Down \u2014 at low HP, grabs player and pulls into ground briefly"
  dropItemIds:
  - Vord Scrap x2-3
  - Burrower Claw (rare, ammo material)
  boss_section: Vord Fodder
